Aether is an independent implementation inspired by the publicly available
architecture and documentation of Hermes Agent.

Upstream project: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
Upstream copyright: Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research
Upstream license: MIT (full text preserved in docs/UPSTREAM_LICENSE.md)

